  "releaseNotes": "### 14.4.11.1\n\n* Fixes native libraries that required macOS 26; the minimum supported macOS version is now 14.0. (GH#3813)\n\n#### Imaging\n\n* Fixes an exception when drawing a clipped image onto another image in the cross-platform .NET package. (GH#3832)\n\n#### OCR\n\n* Fixes a crash when OCR with several languages reads a word differently in each language. (GH#3786)\n\n#### Office\n\n* Fixes Markdown-to-PDF conversion producing raster pages with no extractable text. (L#GDPIC-1660)\n* Fixes PowerPoint tables using the \"No Style, No Grid\" table style being rendered with black cell borders. (L#MAMBO-2132)\n* Fixes right-to-left text order and column-break layout when converting Word documents to PDF. (L#MAMBO-2045)\n* Fixes Word documents failing to open with InvalidParameter when a table cell spans zero grid columns. (L#MAMBO-2136)\n\n#### PDF\n\n* Fixes PDF text extraction joining a label with the text it covers, and dropping characters from widely spaced rows. (GH#3847)\n* Fixes PDF text extraction losing characters a font maps to spaces, and the paint order of rotated text. (GH#3857)\n* Fixes title metadata preservation and annotation placement when editing PDF tags. (GH#3627)\n\n#### Templating\n\n* Adds HTML placeholder values to Office templates, rendered in Word as formatted text, lists, links, tables and images. (L#OFTAPI-28)",
